      "assumption": "Mandatory data-lineage reporting is a technically and politically feasible mechanism for democratic oversight.",
      "if_wrong": "If enforcement is impossible due to the complexity of training sets, the policy must shift toward strict liability for model outputs rather than input regulation."
    }
  ]
}

